    "raw": "Phase changes: 368.3 K, orthorhombic - monoclinic transition point of S; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.096$ kcal/mol. \n388.36 K, melting point of S; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.413$ kcal/mol. \n411 K, $\\alpha - \\beta$ transition point of FeS; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.560$ kcal/mol. \n432.02 K, second order transformation of S; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0$ kcal/mol. \n598 K, β - γ transition point of FeS; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.095$ kcal/mol. \n717.824 K, boiling point of S to equilibrium mixture of $S_{n}$ (n = 1 to 8). \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n<table><tr><td>298.15-411 K:</td><td> $Cp^o$  = -80.385 + 199.956 $x10^{-3}T$  + 29.540 $x10^5T^{-2}$ </td></tr><tr><td>411-598 K:</td><td> $H^o-H_{298}^o$  = -80.385 $x10^{-3}T$  + 99.978 $x10^{-6}T^2$  - 29.540 $x10^2T^{-1}$  + 24.987 $Cp^o$  = 17.351</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">598-1465 K:</td><td> $H^o-H_{298}^o$  = 17.351 $x10^{-3}T$  - 4.921 $Cp^o$  = 6.041 + 6.678 $x10^{-3}T$  + 16.479 $x10^5T^{-2}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $H^o-H_{298}^o$  = 6.041 $x10^{-3}T$  + 3.339 $x10^{-6}T^2$  - 16.479 $x10^2T^{-1}$  + 3.499</td></tr></table>\nFormation equations (kcal/mol): \n<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">298.15-368.3 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = 3.691 - 88.338 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T} + 95.624 \\times 10^{-6} \\text{T}^{2} - 2881.100 \\text{T}^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = 3.691 + 88.338 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T} \\ln T - 95.624 \\times 10^{-6} \\text{T}^{2} - 1440.550 \\text{T}^{-1} - 551.071 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T}$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">368.3-388.36 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = 2.576 - 86.075 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T} + 93.878 \\times 10^{-6} \\text{T}^{2} - 2725.500 \\text{T}^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = 2.576 + 86.075 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T} \\ln T - 93.878 \\times 10^{-6} \\text{T}^{2} - 1362.750 \\text{T}^{-1} - 535.888 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T}$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">388.36-411 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -13.583 - 41.335 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T} + 50.596 \\times 10^{-6} \\text{T}^{2} - 823.300 \\text{T}^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -13.583 + 41.335 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T} \\ln T - 50.596 \\times 10^{-6} \\text{T}^{2} - 411.650 \\text{T}^{-1} - 250.660 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T}$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">411-432.02 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -43.491 + 56.401 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T} - 49.382 \\times 10^{-6} \\text{T}^{2} + 2130.700 \\text{T}^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -43.491 - 56.401 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T} \\ln T + 49.382 \\times 10^{-6} \\text{T}^{2} + 1065.350 \\text{T}^{-1} + 360.509 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T}$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">432.02-598 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -52.970 + 52.495 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T} - 29.570 \\times 10^{-6} \\text{T}^{2} + 5357.200 \\text{T}^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -52.970 - 52.495 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T} \\ln T + 29.570 \\times 10^{-6} \\text{T}^{2} + 2678.600 \\text{T}^{-1} + 358.661 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T}$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">598-717.824 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -44.550 + 41.185 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T} - 26.231 \\times 10^{-6} \\text{T}^{2} + 3709.300 \\text{T}^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -44.550 - 41.185 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T} \\ln T + 26.231 \\times 10^{-6} \\text{T}^{2} + 1854.650 \\text{T}^{-1} + 276.570 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{T}$ </td></tr></table>",
